{"parse": {"title": "FT-12", "pageid": 55364, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-11\" title=\"FT-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-13\" title=\"FT-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A9.BA.E6.A3.BA.E6.9F.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"空棺柩\">空棺柩</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 空棺柩</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Empty Coffin</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiuguanneifangjian\"><img alt=\"jiuguanneifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/600px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/900px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-jiuguanneifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶瓶罐罐立在桌面上，风干的药草被麻线捆起，安放在角落中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不计其数的名片在火炉中，只剩下了片片残骸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火炉边缘，一只箱子半敞着，露出熟悉的黑色面具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">医生：</div><div>抱歉，在我见过的所有病人里，都从未出现过如此——匪夷所思的情况，人类的医学恐怕已经起不到太大的作用，这已经远超过了我的所能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他向着坐椅上受伤的男人摘下了帽子，深深鞠了一躬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后提起手提箱，转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将名片攒在拳头中，拧成一团，丢入火炉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一扇门传来了叩响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未等他的回答，门便被擅自打开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>你到底想干什么，老头？！我听说你带着那帮刚来的新崽子去了一趟海特街，可没有任何人提前告诉我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>你明知道这群愣头愣脑的狗崽子里，保不齐谁会反咬你一口！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>反咬一口？呵呵……谢谢你为我着想，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>我听说，你的匕首找到了，是吗？是哪位好心人给你送了回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>是那位在新纪元集市的女士吗？你最近对她很上心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莱格斯将一叠封好的信封，丢到了桌面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>你已经跟着我离开了有一段年数……我准备让你回意大利一趟，好好待一阵子……记得替我向你的母亲问好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>站在桌前的杰洛哑然失笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>……瞧瞧你在说什么，老头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他对着面前的男人，缓缓举起了枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>五年前，当我们这帮移民的穷小子被揍得鼻青脸肿的时候，你告诉我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>如果就这样灰溜溜地滚回老家，回到那个属于神秘学家的犄角旮旯的村庄，还不如干脆地赏自己一枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>你答应我们，会在这里扎根，会让这里成为另一片故土。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>我们这些神秘学家混账从没有如此相信过一个人类——全因我们都是被这个社会抛弃的可怜虫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>我们都明白，面包与尊严大过了种族与出身，仇恨与偏见不能果腹，所以我们才如此尊敬你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他持枪的手颤抖着，言语愈发地激动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>小拇指杰瑞死在了浴缸里，他母亲到现在还以为他在跟着我们跑船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>矮子肯，他一辈子都在干端盘子的营生，却被那群混账的子弹射得面目全非，他的女儿才刚刚出生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>而我的妻子萨菲娜死在了不知名的纵火者手里，那帮该死的警察直到现在都一声不吭！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>我们拥有自己的原则，也赢得了尊重和血淋淋的钞票，比我们父辈在船厂一辈子赚得都要多——而如今，你却宁愿与那帮“启明会”的疯子们混在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>私人诊所因此不再愿意为我们提供治疗，因为他们明白我们不再有原则，我们手里拿到的，都是从那些像我们当初那样饿肚子的穷人手里窃走的钞票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>我们庇护着一群让孩子流离失所、让穷人走向末路的家伙，我们失去了人们的信任，而你还要为此推开我们，让更多人流血！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手臂就像提着重石一般，晃动、打颤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>杰洛，我的孩子……你还远没有看到一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莱格斯走过去，用手握住了颤抖的枪口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>旋即宛如慈父接过赠礼，将枪拿回到自己手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>你甚至也没准备杀死我，即便你咬了她的“骨头”，却仍然那么忠诚，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰洛如同一匹折断腿的马，倾倒在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-626011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-626011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-626011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>呃啊……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但他的手枪并没有指向杰洛的脑袋，而是指向了漆黑的走廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>我一直想知道是谁在蛊惑我的孩子，令他生出一些不应有的怜悯与愧疚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>让他无法贯彻自己的意志，让他甚至连枪也拿不稳，如此令我蒙羞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-309510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……杰洛先生的犹豫便是他的意志，莱格斯先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从走廊的阴影中，缓缓走出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>一发子弹并非要射出枪膛，才能唤来寂静与和解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>杰洛先生选择将自己的生命当作最后的劝诫，我想您应该比任何人都理解此事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我不会阻止您杀死杰洛先生……因为这是属于他的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将枪口抵在杰洛喘息的胸膛上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杰洛伸出一只手，挽住了他的肩膀，仿若一个邀请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>抱歉，老头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪被抛到了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>带这个孩子离开这里，我已经不需要他那胆怯的忠诚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>先生，您误会了……我来到这里，并非为了帮助杰洛先生，更无意见证他的自我献身——我仅是遵循了自己的意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我应邀而来——只是为了加入你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她点点头，说出了一个既定的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>确切的说，我像刚才那位医生一样，为了您而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光，扫视着火炉、药草、箱子……将房间的一切尽收眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，定睛在了地毯之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>呼……原来如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我无数次看见人们将能量聚集于自己身上，他们将自己的生命与欲望视作中心，夺取着他人的手中之物，利用与榨取他人的血肉，来填充自己的空洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>杰洛先生不是那种人……您，也不是。我能看清您身上的光晕——您的灵魂、您的宿愿——它未聚焦于您自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>它只属于这个房间中的第四个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她举起手，指向了淌着鲜血的地毯之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>您一直瞒着所有人，将他藏在这所房间下面，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她提着灯，迈下这漆黑不见底的阶梯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而前方的带路者，目中无光，手上亦无依靠，他的每一步却都踏实在黑暗中，未曾落空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿若踏在故乡的归途上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呛人的气味扑鼻而来，仿若一群密密麻麻的虫子窜入了肺部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑色的霉菌以床架为中心，向地面、墙体扩散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>咳咳……呵——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>床上瘦骨嶙峋的躯体弓了起来，从喉咙的疮口中，咳出脓黄色的孢子雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……莱格斯先生，这就是您所做的一切的缘由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>死亡本已将他啃食殆尽……而你却执着地抓住了他，试图将这位可怜人的生命与痛苦一并弥留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起床架旁边的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是两个站在大学前，搭着肩膀，样貌别无二致的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>外界的传言并不是空穴来风，传到人们耳中的可怜人的哀嚎……正属于这位先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>而您，一个人类，也并未受到术法的庇护，您从来都是一副血肉之躯……那几发子弹从未贯穿过您的颅脑，因为——你们本就不是同一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>如今躺在床上的人，才是莱格斯先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用拇指捏碎掌心的干草，又在食指侧咬出了一道血口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星将混合了草末的鲜血，轻抹在那枯槁消瘦、宛如干尸的脸颊之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红色的血液开始攀爬，沿着菌丝爬进他的喉咙、耳鼻——肺腑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>“启明会”为您提供的手段，能令他以残破的躯体苟延残喘……但也同时蒙蔽了他的意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>咳、咳……！呕……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一大团脓包状的菌子，从他的喉咙中倾泻而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我只能让他清醒片刻，但这无法延续他正在衰竭的生命之河，“莱格斯”先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闭上双眼，伸出手，一团光晕渐渐笼罩住了失去意识的病人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病人的眼眸缓缓睁开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>咳、咳……兄弟，你在我身上实验了不少东西，可把我折磨得够呛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>呵呵……咳咳咳，我这一身滑稽的样子，活像一块发霉的面包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>是你吗？莱格斯……我的兄弟！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>听我说，我发誓、我发誓，我已经找到了让你继续活下去的方法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而床上的病人只是摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>你当上教授了吗，我的弟弟？这一身衣服可不像你的派头，咳、咳……我还是喜欢你戴上金丝眼镜，那副愤世嫉俗、喋喋不休的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>我现在成了你，我的兄弟……那群街区的孩子需要你，所以我放弃了那纸破文凭，选择重新构筑你的王国……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>如今，我们已经共有了声望与权力，就跟当初你所期盼的一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>咳咳，不，听着，我不希望你这样，弟弟。你本该在律师事务所工作，正大光明地从那帮有钱的吝啬鬼手里拿走他们的钞票……你的手不应该沾上别人的鲜血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>你、你得离开这里……我所做的一切，都只是为了你能拥有自己的生活，而不是重蹈我的覆辙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>其他人怎么样了，咳咳……矮子肯和小拇指杰瑞呢，这两个踏踏实实的臭小子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>我不应该把他们带出来做事的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>他们回家了，哥哥，他们回家了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>是吗……我早就知道，他们俩根本就不适合干这些脏活计……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的吐息更微弱了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>噢，瞧，我已经睡太久了，弟弟，我的脑子迷糊了……真累，我的眼皮就像该死的黏上了蜂蜜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他试图睁大眼睛，眼皮却沉沉地半盖在眼眸上，纹丝不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>咳、咳……我现在是在哪儿，我现在是在哪儿？你能告诉我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头顶的灯光摇摇晃晃，照进他眯成一条缝的眼睛里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>噢，那是……阳光吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的神志越来越飘渺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>我好像……好像听到了妈妈在厨房里，她在叫你的名字，也在叫我的名字……是我们偷朗姆酒的事儿又露馅了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>床上的人笑得一喘一喘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>哥哥，不——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>是的，那是晨曦，先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>我感觉……它可真暖和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>你们……还在故乡，“莱格斯”先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默着的弟弟，还是把想象中的梦接续了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……我们就在西西里，莱格斯……我们正一起住在你的卧室里，老爹刚把咱们都揍了一顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>他就在门口抽着烟斗，说要把我们拴在家里，让我们放弃那下半辈子多半会落个残废的营生，让我们安身立命，让我们把腿扎进西西里的土壤里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>莱格斯，抱歉……我们没能买到船票，没能去成美国。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>妈妈让我们把收拾好的行李放回去，它们太多了，把你这个四肢发达的混账都累瘫了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>噢，我们没能去成美国吗？真遗憾，我的兄弟，咳、咳……可是，可是，那也……真好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奄奄一息的人，面容那般释然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抓住弟弟的手，那柄手枪便握在其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>该死……我的眼睛已经快睁不开了，老爹那几个结实的拳头真是打到我脑门上了……我得睡一觉，我得继续睡一觉——别再吵醒我了，小子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>记得多翻翻你那堆乱七八糟的书……咱们家里得出一个靠脑子吃饭的伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>明白吗？咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>……没问题，没问题，哥哥……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病人枯槁的手掌，覆在了他持枪的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人：</div><div>明天见，老弟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是漫长的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一直到那颗心脏，停止了最后的跳动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dixiasushefangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>这一刻终于来了。我不会怪罪杰洛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱格斯：</div><div>——我理解了你们的选择。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-12"}}